index="-1" class="oEQhK8JBXLVuvQKG5RoE"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL e7uH5SSTKFAF4q1CThi9"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 375px, (min-width: 768px) 25vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/27608d06d66e479e84b19595b7cfaeea/eventkalender-1250x730-mal-2_1250_730-3.jpg?width=175 175w, /contentassets/27608d06d66e479e84b19595b7cfaeea/eventkalender-1250x730-mal-2_1250_730-3.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/27608d06d66e479e84b19595b7cfaeea/eventkalender-1250x730-mal-2_1250_730-3.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/27608d06d66e479e84b19595b7cfaeea/eventkalender-1250x730-mal-2_1250_730-3.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/27608d06d66e479e84b19595b7cfaeea/eventkalender-1250x730-mal-2_1250_730-3.jpg?width=500" alt="Foredragsholder Wolfgang Ernst holder et papir i et rotete ro,. samt tittelen på eventet. " style="object-position:70% 15%" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="Hc86mf7VQzuE0sjRszh3"><div class="Yfcw8ymxnbdg0OCRymJM"><h3 class="ZQjkZpCrfIoS_HGXW6SA"><a href="/om-kristiania/kalender/kai-evening-artificial-intelligence-as-an-epistemic-toy/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi yotw7QFgjwSKmxcZyI3X" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><div>kAI-evening: “Artificial Intelligence as an Epistemic Toy”&nbsp;</div></div></a></h3><div class="Qvowk3q3ceqfi8X6O8QM"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-map-pin"></use></svg></span>Kirkegata 24</div><div class="ZNqQmBQypUtT6HTMRYFA"><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-clock"></use></svg></span><time datetime="17:00-19:30">17:00-19:30</time></div></div><div class="OPIpMaIbc5uQ5TuH3O8M">Hvordan «tenker» kunstig intelligens, og hva kan teknologien fortelle oss om menneskelig kunnskap, tenkning og intelligens? Hva skjer egentlig inne i KI, og hva betyr det å være intelligent?&nbsp;</div></div></div></li><li class="HX6wO974dMeHJIhiCO6h"><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="oEQhK8JBXLVuvQKG5Ro